 "why": "Sparse codes were on the list of mechanisms to build next, and racing experts and the cerebellar sheet had been tried, on the thought that the Transformer holds its knowledge in units that are open at few bytes, where a third to a half of the stack's cells fire at a byte (learning_rate_by_context.json). The Transformer had not been measured.",
